[9.777535, "i", "printf '%s\\n' '--- TREE.txt ---'; cat /app/treenote/TREE.txt; printf '%s\\n' '--- forms.txt ---'; cat /app/treenote/forms.txt\n"]
[9.778053, "o", "printf '%s\\n' '--- TREE.txt ---'; cat /app/treenote/TREE.txt; printf '%s\\n' '--- forms.txt ---'; cat /app/treenote/forms.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[9.778432, "o", "--- TREE.txt ---\r\n"]
[9.779654, "o", "Commands:\r\n  /app/bin/oakurn pour /app/caskbay/core.urn\r\n  /app/bin/oakurn pour /app/caskbay/z9.urn\r\n  /app/bin/oakurn steep\r\n  /app/bin/oakurn board\r\n\r\n  /app/latchpit\r\n  /app/stampwire\r\n  /app/dayfold\r\n  /app/ribcli\r\n\r\nProducts:\r\n  /app/inkpit/counts.json\r\n  /app/inkpit/emit.inc\r\n  /app/bin/oakurn\r\n\r\nScratch:\r\n  /app/snapvat\r\n  /app/snapvat/live\r\n  /app/snapvat/busy.latch\r\n\r\nUrns:\r\n  /app/caskbay\r\n  /app/caskbay/core.urn\r\n  /app/caskbay/quiet.urn\r\n  /app/caskbay/z9.urn\r\n  /app/snapvat/live\r\n"]
[9.779922, "o", "--- forms.txt ---\r\n"]
[9.780855, "o", "URN1 records use three fields, one per line after the URN1 banner:\r\n\r\nid <token>\r\nday YYYY-MM-DD\r\nn <integer>\r\n\r\ncounts.json is one object. Key order is days then covers.\r\n\r\ndays maps calendar day strings to integer totals. Each urn contributes its n to the day written on that urn.\r\n\r\ncovers is the identifier of the urn last folded by steep.\r\n\r\nShipped samples: id core on 2024-03-11 with n 3; id quiet on 2024-03-10 with n 2.\r\nValid extra id token z9 may use day 1999-01-01.\r\n"]
[9.781054, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@7c2064acc33c:/app# "]
[9.935149, "i", "printf '%s\\n' '--- files ---'; find /app -maxdepth 4 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort\n"]
[9.935536, "o", "printf '%s\\n' '--- files ---'; find /app -maxdepth 4 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r--- files ---\r\n"]
